       "name": "Imperial Law",
       "text": "At the start of the battle, select one unit from your opponent’s army. Each time a model in this unit makes an attack that targets that unit, that attack has the [LETHAL HITS] and [PRECISION] abilities.",
       "kind": "datasheet"
